# Render Speechless: Bot2 answers with Teferi's Protection, gaining protection from everything, so "target opponent" is no longer
# legal. A spell with a legal target left is not countered (CR 608.2b): it does as much as it can, so Bot2's hand is not revealed or
# taken from (the Lightning Bolt stays) while Ornithopter still gets its two +1/+1 counters.

